{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0034_1001_p", "source_sha256": "64a6c6d6eb81c6a234472f60dd79f41aa5eb1df1503fb032b695ea42f4e11f2c", "ja": "えっ！？\nど、どうしたんだ。なにがあったんだ、恵美。", "zh": "咦！？\n怎、怎么啦？发生什么事了，惠美！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0034_1002_020meg", "source_sha256": "f1feaccdf9460065571d33341bdbeffd2f27a1aee465b8763bb46f9f5c67f39b", "ja": "うぅ……だって、衣装が……衣装がぁ～……。", "zh": "呜呜……因为、服装……服装……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
