{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0034_1004_020meg", "source_sha256": "12ce56669f0a825a9b4c26ad6faa97d07bc76484aa264253fa911394ac8c22ac", "ja": "この衣装着てると、この前のライブを思い出して……\nううっ、なんか、泣けてきちゃうんだってば～っ！", "zh": "只要穿上这套服装，我就会想起之前的演唱会……\n呜呜，就忍不住想哭嘛～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0034_1005_p", "source_sha256": "9659ee5591a56e64b076b402f70dd4ae7e0f713d44c2b8cbaa1cf09a0624a9ba", "ja": "なんだ、そんなことだったのか……。", "zh": "什么啊，原来是这种小事啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0034_1006_020meg", "source_sha256": "dfd2cf2257c7798c2630e0afc921aa612c2069af742169be7b77ae52e3bcf8b9", "ja": "そんなコトじゃないよ～！？\nアタシにとっては、チョー大事なコトなんだから！", "zh": "才不是小事好吗～！？\n对我而言，这超重要的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0034_1007_020meg", "source_sha256": "50d8cff99be6eb14b0d2192ea8aa32dfcf8f4379fbb0c3a3dbfec86ee73e74d7", "ja": "アタシ、こんな衣装も、あんなステージも初めてで……\nもう、めちゃくちゃ感動したんだからね！", "zh": "不管这套服装还是那场表演，\n对我来说都是第一次……我真的感动到不行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0034_1008_p", "source_sha256": "d5899274873e2ba6f6550ab9896c3d224ada78c83d746d189866cc1241838afe", "ja": "いや、もちろんそれはわかってるけど。\nしかし困ったな……これから衣装の調整だろ？", "zh": "不，这我当然明白。\n不过真伤脑筋啊……等会不是还要调整服装吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0034_1009_020meg", "source_sha256": "da7444b6ebebf54460e8f8280a125969b0679c4e3fcb6d7c4220a99ce3787597", "ja": "うん……でも、ちょっとサイズ直すだけだから。\nウエスト詰めるくらい、アタシ、自分でできるし……。", "zh": "嗯……只是修一下尺寸而已啦。\n只是把腰身修细这种程度，我自己也做得来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0034_1010_020meg", "source_sha256": "0a180c544539bacdcb1814f01080d770ea923abf567144a9aaef29c90906b3f7", "ja": "だから、{$P$}。美咲に、\nもう着替えてもいいか、聞いてもらえないかな？", "zh": "所以，{$P$}，\n可以帮我问问美咲能换衣服了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0034_1011_020meg", "source_sha256": "d424ca34e91a066db248385c46f1eb878b82a819ec188a1af7609c217cb7fff6", "ja": "こんな顔、恥ずかしくて、{$P$}\n以外には見せられないよ～……。", "zh": "我这个表情太丢人了，\n不能让{$P$}以外的人看见啦……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0034_1012_p", "source_sha256": "5c5f9a4f96e4407919c31fd110097b1012548362dbbbff97557ea79ebde4925d", "ja": "わ、わかった。\n衣装を脱いでいいか、今すぐ青羽さんに聞いてくるな。", "zh": "我、我知道了。\n我马上去问青羽小姐服装能不能换下来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
